    "description": {
      "value": "<p><b>Knight of the Sacred Word · уровень 6</b></p><p>You master your breath and body, allowing your voice to shape your own form.<br>Steadfast Voice. When you fail a saving throw, you can spend 1 Focus Point to add your Martial Arts die to the roll, potentially turning failure into success.<br>Purifying Breath. At the start of your turn, you can spend 1 Focus Point to end one of the following conditions on yourself: Paralyzed or Stunned.<br>Striking Word. When you use Voice of Authority, you can deal extra Force damage equal to one roll of your<br>Martial Arts die if the target fails its saving throw.</p><hr><p><b>Автоматизация / ограничения:</b></p><ul><li>Purifying Breath — макрос управления в начале хода.</li></ul>"
